msgid "ARK PAB Power Module"
msgstr "ARK PAB 电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-power-modules.rst:12
#: 01567af14566493abb2158397420903e 30478cbe66e44cf38859f591f5a8448a
#: 5c1c393edca645eda5620dc9eccae720 6d45c92d1ada45e48df16c11e952e88b
#: c7d80ee89d414d359382fd5e71bf69ef
msgid ""
"The ARK PAB Power Module is rated for 60A continuous battery current at 20C "
"ambient. However, when running 60A battery current at 20C without cooling, "
"the 5V regulator is de-rated to 3A continuous output. It is recommended to "
"run multiple power modules in parallel if more than 60A continuous current "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"ARK PAB 电源模块在 20°C 环境温度下持续电池电流额定值为 60A。但在 20°C 无冷却条件下运行 60A 电池电流时，5V "
"稳压器的持续输出降额至 3A。如需超过 60A 持续电流，建议并联多个电源模块。"

